      "content": "Figure 2. N5500 Rear Panel"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0102",
      "reading_order": 128,
      "section": "1.3 Description of the N5500 Patient Monitor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 147.75,
        "t": 224.94692406000001,
        "r": 539.0622825,
        "b": 174.87957743166294
      },
      "content": "The  N5500  patient  monitor  has  a  color  liquid  crystal  display  (LCD).  The  Numeric frames on  the  screen  contain  five  numeric  values  are  displayed.  T he  Graphic  Frames contain three equally sized graphic frames in which real-time physiological waveforms, graphical trend, or tabular trend data are displayed."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0103",
      "reading_order": 129,
      "section": "1.3 Description of the N5500 Patient Monitor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 147.75,
        "t": 157.44692406000001,
        "r": 537.6243645143995,
        "b": 134.37957743166294
      },
      "content": "Controlling is accomplished by using the  knob to interact with the appropriate area or icon on the screen."
    }
